// Template for the source-bound Saved Music refresh fixture. run_sleep_timer.py replaces
// every //@EXTRACT line with the named member copied from the production source, then
// compiles the result with the real PurpleSleepTimerRules. The classes here only supply
// inert stock endpoints and test-only fields; the timer facade, Audio classification and
// the MediaController refresh fallback are production text.
